      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Hoffman, Dr. Grasmehr, and Dr. Swann for their thorough examinations and gentle manner. Clients appreciate the attentive bedside approach and how clinicians take time to explain treatment plans without rushing appointments."
      }
