        "en": "Comforting handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably staff handle anxious dogs and spirited felines during clinical procedures. The veterinary team speaks softly, uses calm techniques to minimize pet stress, and keeps animals relaxed throughout blood draws and vaccinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed explanations alongside front desk delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Feedback regarding communication is largely positive regarding diagnostic explanations and swift text updates from doctors. However, a few reviewers report occasional front desk lapses, including unreturned follow-up calls and unanswered waiting room check-ins."
      }
    }
